      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24069/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix melted butter, flour, sugar, oats, and 1 tablespoon cinnamon to form a crumbly mixture. Sprinkle over apples.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gBnqfHbxT_fPC53V6Yg80HXmonA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24069-nanas-apple-crisp-VAT-step-02-76918fd91f62460683916ec95c8af79d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24069/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dot with remaining 1/4 cup butter, and sprinkle with remaining 1 tablespoon cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O-k2u96br60-wSkVllqpEXquyZQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24069-nanas-apple-crisp-VAT-step-03-8a5020998fc54940805dd6a9c8e1e36c.jpg"
